    "description": "<p>Absorbs spells cast directly at the wielder and allows the wielder to cast a spell from his own memory using that power (and thus not losing the spell from memory).</p><p>Once the staff has absorbed 50 levels of spells (whether or not the power has been cast back out again), it no longer absorbs spells.</p><p>This staff of gnarled, dark wood has a crystalline tip that draws in incoming magic like a sponge. It feels strangely empty when held.</p>",
